'll be able to make an  informed decision and  uh  go into a department go into an  institute uh which will be  the perfect solution to this  uh to this  to what is actually a nice optimization  problem okay so this this jake and this  jaw counselling selecting the department  and the institute is ultimately not a  maximization problem it is ultimately an  optimization problem better here it's a  constrained optimization problem and i  hope you get the perfect solution to  this optimization problem so all the  best  thank you

